Template: tindra/public_url
Type: string
Default:
Description: Public URL of Tindra:
 The address users and Sentry SDKs reach Tindra at, for example
 https://tindra.example.com. With an https:// URL, login cookies are marked
 secure.
 .
 Leave it empty to configure Tindra later with "dpkg-reconfigure tindra";
 it isn't started until then.

Template: tindra/port
Type: string
Default: 8080
Description: Port Tindra listens on:

Template: tindra/local_proxy
Type: boolean
Default: true
Description: Is the reverse proxy (Caddy, nginx, ...) on this machine?
 Tindra then listens on 127.0.0.1 only and trusts the proxy's forwarded
 client addresses. Otherwise it listens on all interfaces.

Template: tindra/trusted_proxies
Type: string
Default:
Description: Addresses of the reverse proxies:
 Comma-separated IP addresses or CIDRs of the proxies that forward requests
 to Tindra, for example 10.0.0.5. Leave it empty when Tindra is reached
 directly; it then ignores forwarded headers.

Template: tindra/local_database
Type: boolean
Default: true
Description: Set up a local PostgreSQL database for Tindra?
 A role and a database "tindra" are created on this machine's PostgreSQL
 server, with a random password. Choose no to use another server.

Template: tindra/database_url
Type: string
Default:
Description: PostgreSQL connection URL:
 For example postgres://tindra:secret@db.example.com:5432/tindra. Characters
 such as @, : or / in the password must be percent-encoded.

Template: tindra/admin_email
Type: string
Default:
Description: Email address of the first account:
 This account gets full management permissions. Leave it empty to create
 accounts later with "tindra users create".

Template: tindra/admin_name
Type: string
Default:
Description: Name of the first account:

Template: tindra/admin_password
Type: password
Description: Password of the first account:
 At least 12 characters. It is only used to create the account and isn't
 stored.

Template: tindra/password_too_short
Type: error
Description: The password is too short
 Tindra needs at least 12 characters.
